@startuml 02b_kien_truc
!include _style.iuml

title Kien truc — cac cong va bo chuyen doi

' =====================================================================
'  Day KHONG phai so do lop. So do lop (02) tra loi "he thong co nhung
'  doi tuong nghiep vu gi". Hinh nay tra loi mot cau khac: "he thong cam
'  vao the gioi ben ngoai o dau, va thay duoc cai gi".
'
'  Moi cong duoc khai bao BEN TRONG loi va hien thuc ben ngoai, nen moi
'  mui ten deu chi huong vao trong. Chi ve ten cong va ten bo chuyen doi
'  — danh sach phuong thuc day du nam trong ma nguon, chep lai o day chi
'  tao them mot cho phai dong bo tay.
' =====================================================================

package "Loi nghiep vu — cong" {
  interface AudioDecoder <<interface>>
  interface AsrEngine <<interface>>
  interface VoiceActivityDetector <<interface>>
  interface Scorer <<interface>>
  interface BlobStore <<interface>>
  interface JobQueue <<interface>>
  interface RateLimiter <<interface>>
  interface PaymentGateway <<interface>>
}

package "Ha tang — bo chuyen doi" {
  class FirstMatchDecoder <<adapter>>
  class SoundFileDecoder <<adapter>>
  class FfmpegDecoder <<adapter>>
  class WhisperEngine <<adapter>>
  class SileroVad <<adapter>>
  class EnergyVad <<adapter>>
  class RidgeScorer <<adapter>>
  class LocalBlobStore <<adapter>>
  class InProcessJobQueue <<adapter>>
  class InMemoryRateLimiter <<adapter>>
  class SandboxGateway <<adapter>>
  class VnpayGateway <<adapter>>
  class StripeGateway <<adapter>>
  class MomoGateway <<adapter>>
}

package "Luu tru — SQLite" {
  class Repository <<adapter>>
  class AuthRepository <<adapter>>
  class TaskRepository <<adapter>>
}

AudioDecoder          <|.. FirstMatchDecoder
AudioDecoder          <|.. SoundFileDecoder
AudioDecoder          <|.. FfmpegDecoder
AsrEngine             <|.. WhisperEngine
VoiceActivityDetector <|.. SileroVad
VoiceActivityDetector <|.. EnergyVad
Scorer                <|.. RidgeScorer
BlobStore             <|.. LocalBlobStore
JobQueue              <|.. InProcessJobQueue
RateLimiter           <|.. InMemoryRateLimiter
PaymentGateway        <|.. SandboxGateway
PaymentGateway        <|.. VnpayGateway
PaymentGateway        <|.. StripeGateway
PaymentGateway        <|.. MomoGateway

' FirstMatchDecoder la mot Composite: no giu cac bo giai ma khac va uy
' thac cho bo dau tien nhan duoc tep.
FirstMatchDecoder o-- "1..*" AudioDecoder : uy thac cho

note bottom of InProcessJobQueue
  Hai bo chuyen doi da ton tai cho mot cong: mot
  the chay that, mot the chay thang cho kiem thu.
  Do la bang chung seam la that chu khong phai trang tri.
end note

note right of StripeGateway
  Cong thanh toan (D034, D035). Bat cung luc
  nhieu cong, quan tri vien chon cho tung don.
  SandboxGateway: trang thu trong ung dung, khong
  co tien that. VnpayGateway, MomoGateway: ket qua
  ky HMAC tra ve dia chi va thong bao. StripeGateway:
  mo phien qua API, doc lai phien, webhook co ky.
  Moi cong mac dinh o moi truong thu; tien that
  can AICEFR_PAYMENTS_LIVE. He thong chi tin ket
  qua dung chu ky, dung cong, dung so tien.
end note

note bottom of Repository
  Bon kho nay CO Y khong ve cong o day.

  `ports.py` co khai mot `ResponseStore` ba phuong
  thuc va mot test ghim rang Repository thoa no,
  nhung `api/main.py` khoi tao bang kieu cu the va
  goi hon hai muoi phuong thuc ngoai cong do. Doi
  SQLite sang PostgreSQL vi the khong phai viet mot
  bo chuyen doi ba phuong thuc ma la viet lai gan
  het Repository.

  Ve no nhu mot seam se hua mot thu chua co, nen
  hinh nay khong ve — va `ports.py` ghi ro gioi han
  ngay trong docstring.
end note
' Bo cuc: xep cac cong thanh mot cot, neu khong PlantUML dat ca bay cai
' tren cung mot hang va hinh rong gap nam lan chieu cao.
AudioDecoder -[hidden]-> AsrEngine
AsrEngine -[hidden]-> VoiceActivityDetector
VoiceActivityDetector -[hidden]-> Scorer
Scorer -[hidden]-> BlobStore
BlobStore -[hidden]-> JobQueue
JobQueue -[hidden]-> RateLimiter
RateLimiter -[hidden]-> PaymentGateway

FirstMatchDecoder -[hidden]-> SoundFileDecoder
SoundFileDecoder -[hidden]-> FfmpegDecoder
FfmpegDecoder -[hidden]-> WhisperEngine
WhisperEngine -[hidden]-> SileroVad
SileroVad -[hidden]-> EnergyVad
EnergyVad -[hidden]-> RidgeScorer
RidgeScorer -[hidden]-> LocalBlobStore
LocalBlobStore -[hidden]-> InProcessJobQueue
InProcessJobQueue -[hidden]-> InMemoryRateLimiter
InMemoryRateLimiter -[hidden]-> SandboxGateway
SandboxGateway -[hidden]-> VnpayGateway
VnpayGateway -[hidden]-> StripeGateway
StripeGateway -[hidden]-> MomoGateway

Repository -[hidden]-> AuthRepository
AuthRepository -[hidden]-> TaskRepository
@enduml
